{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_38","type":"agent_message","text":"The third official run is fully correct at 3.2×–17.4× speedup. Its remaining largest cluster is the hidden-gradient path: three library GEMMs, three full weight casts, two adds, and a final cast. I’m prototyping a single tiled Triton GEMM that reads the original BF16 weights, converts inside the tile, accumulates all three paths in FP32, and writes BF16 directly."}}
